# Built-in lesson. Text fields are bilingual "English|Chinese" (format: src/song/Song.h).
title: Frère Jacques (Two Tigers)|两只老虎
artist: Traditional|传统儿歌
bpm: 90
time: 4/4
level: 1
desc: First position in G. Bars 5 and 6 have eighth notes (two notes per beat) - practice slowly first, then speed up.|第一把位 G 调. 第 5、6 小节有八分音符 (一拍弹两下), 先慢速练熟再加速.
desc: Tip: open string 4 (low D) appears in the last two bars; don't hit string 3 when you pick it.|小贴士: 4弦空弦 (低音 D) 出现在最后两小节, 拨弦时别碰到 3 弦.
